      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Setting the camera depth to overwrite the main view is not officially supported behaviour. As such, we cannot offer a fix here, nor will this be documented on official guidelines.\n\nAs a workaround exists, this should not cause any issues, and it can be documented on community resources like the wiki instead.",
