  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Normally, turning on a Camera Object in a VRChat world switches what is being rendered on screen to what is viewed by the camera. This works fine on Desktop or Quest but not at all on Android / iOS unless you increase the depth setting on the camera to 1 or higher. While this is an easy workaround, to prevent extra headaches, please either add this information to the documentation or have parity with this setting across all platforms to avoid confusion.",
